<title>SINGAPORE: Noel Gifts year net profit up 52 percent.</title>
<headline>Noel Gifts year net profit up 52 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million Singapore dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 0.72  vs     0.47</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)		   1.59  vs     1.04</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)		   8.00  vs     8.00</p>
<p>    Turnover				  20.93  vs    20.77</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   1.06  vs     0.82</p>
<p>    Investment/interest income	   0.44  vs     0.15</p>
<p>    Interest expense			 0.05  vs     0.07</p>
<p>    Depreciation			     0.64  vs     0.56</p>
<p>    Associates				 0.06  vs     0.05</p>
<p>    Tax					  0.38  vs     0.38</p>
<p>Note - Noel Gifts International Ltd makes festival hampers.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
